OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Cafter body of woman found in Carlisle
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof murder, after a body was found in
OL,8,FCarlisle.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,Freports that a woman in her 60s had
OL,12,Fsuddenly died at a property in the
OL,13,Farea of Caldewgate on Sunday 2 August.
OL,14,FShe was declared dead at the scene.
OL,16,FCumbria Police have arrested a man,
OL,17,Falso in his 60s, and say
OL,18,Finvestigations are ongoing.
