OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Cafter body of woman found in Carlisle
OL,6,FOfficers say there will be an
OL,7,Fincreased police presence in the area
OL,8,Fwhile they carry out enquiries.
OL,10,FIn a statement put out on Facebook,
OL,11,FCumbria Police said: "We would like to
OL,12,Freassure the public that there is no
OL,13,Fwider threat to the community and ask
OL,14,Fthat people avoid speculation whilst
OL,15,Fthe investigation is ongoing."
